  "findings": [
    "8101 knock /mini-toplist/knock,8102 query /mini-toplist/query,8103 delete /mini-toplist/delete. Typed request fields restored. Win score equals source Match rate times wins; caller weight only extension totalScore. Player query retains request cache including old category/name/offset until list query send returns; thrown Send retains cache.",
    "Base HTTP success events parse response code with LitJSON then emit success or error/report, and invoke protocol callback even on nonzero business code. Rank upload callback ignores body; query JsonUtility parser rejects nonzero code and routes Mine versus List by data.count==0, not data.no. Network-failure event reports-9999 and does not invoke protocol callback. Current callbacks and dictionaries are reread after event/report side effects.",
    "AES-CBC/PKCS7 uses16 UTF16chars padded with0 or truncated, UTF8 bytes for both key and IV, UTF8 StreamWriter BOM. Independent OpenSSL vector plaintext {\"msg\":\"原版\",\"code\":0}, keyabc, ciphertext x4DKo+xbPobmUvTENmnGYmhYydkmxvrRXbBfi/jnA9Y= matches. Crypto failures report1008(encrypt)/1007(decrypt), log exception and returnnull unless report/log itself throws. Protocol2 is ServerTime and bypasses encryption. Original unused Decode methods28199/28203 not ported.",
